Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 12:09:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 25/26] video_core: Ocarina network replaced from its real
 input (cb0+0xc0, the E5B9G9R9 scene colour at the rendered size) with a
 sampled blit, since E5B9G9R9 is no 2D engine format

(cherry picked from commit 25ffd5cf31c1f8b01233ff454154affe80b1ed41)
---
